# Quantinuum Helios as Goal 3 judges it: the rule set `helios` (the website's general rules and the
# published floorplan, HL1-HL4) and R34, the team's feedback F2 (Ke, 2026-11-07), which Goal 3 applies
# to every architecture: a laser step addresses one chain position, so the two ions of an operation
# zone are pulsed one position at a time.  `helios` itself is left as it is (the Rules page's demo).

ruleset "helios-deck"
title "Quantinuum Helios, as Goal 3 judges it"
about "The general programme and transport rules, the published Helios floorplan (one storage ring, one X junction, eight two-ion operation zones, logic only there, a ring that turns under broadcast control), and a laser step reaches one chain position: where a zone holds two ions, a pulse reaches the ones at the same position in every zone it plays in."

include "helios"

use R34
